    {
      "Key": "CAT_DESCRIPTION_001",
      "String": "Muffin is a very affectionate kitty, and loves to be petted constantly! If you stop, she will gently tap you with her paw until you resume."
    },
    {
      "Key": "CAT_DESCRIPTION_002",
      "String": "Despite being a lover, not a fighter, Loveable once had a scrap with a roving tom cat who broke his jaw! He’s a big cuddler and will drool a lot with a loud purr when he’s happy, showing off his charming crooked smile."
    },
    {
      "Key": "CAT_DESCRIPTION_003",
      "String": "Bon-Chan is a tiny kitty with a big sense of self-confidence. Since her adoption, she has found great happiness in supervising and napping with her loved ones."
    },
    {
      "Key": "CAT_DESCRIPTION_004",
      "String": "At least twice the size of his sister Bon-chan, Takeshi is a big ball of cuddly. He loves to eat, and is often caught taking a nibble from other cats food bowls."
    },
    {
      "Key": "CAT_DESCRIPTION_005",
      "String": "Cool as a cucumber, Salem has a “devil may care” attitude. She is oblivious to rules and regulations and will often find herself bewildered by the anger of others."
    },
    {
      "Key": "CAT_DESCRIPTION_006",
      "String": "Timid toward new customers, Woolie’s trust can only be gained after plenty of pats. Extremely affectionate and a keen conversationalist, he will talk in tiny meows."
    },
    {
      "Key": "CAT_DESCRIPTION_007",
      "String": "Armed with the ability to backflip, blep and excessively drool, Holly Janis Blakie is one big show off. She loves everyone she meets but unconditionally loathes dogs."
    },
    {
      "Key": "CAT_DESCRIPTION_008",
      "String": "Rad is incredibly loyal and polite and will always wait for customers to enter doorways before him, a real classy gentleman. Although sudden movements can frighten him, he loves a good pat from everyone who visits the cafe!"
    },
    {
      "Key": "CAT_DESCRIPTION_009",
      "String": "Babs is special because she has slightly crossed eyes that make her extra cute! She likes to curl up in tight dark corners and dream about hearty meals of tuna, salmon and warm milk."
    },
    {
      "Key": "CAT_DESCRIPTION_010",
      "String": "After being spooked in an accident that gave him his trademark scar, shy little Shadow takes his time warming up to strangers. When he becomes familiar his playful yet docile self comes out, and he can often be found hiding in customer shopping bags."
    },
    {
      "Key": "CAT_DESCRIPTION_011",
      "String": "The silliest of little scoundrels, Whiskers loves to tease her fellow kittens. She will often play with their tails and pounce on them while they sleep. Whiskers fully embodies her title of the naughty class clown."
    },
    {
      "Key": "CAT_DESCRIPTION_012",
      "String": "Noodle has often been seen walking on her hind legs, thinking that she is “a people.” She’ll sit next to customers at their tables and curiously stroll around the espresso machine playing with fallen coffee beans."
    },
    {
      "Key": "CAT_DESCRIPTION_013",
      "String": "Mochi is obsessed with being tidy. Her first duty every morning is to lick herself clean from head to toe. She also loves to have her fur brushed, but is fairly fickle when it comes to being picked up."
    },
    {
      "Key": "CAT_DESCRIPTION_014",
      "String": "As music fills the cafe, Chacha becomes a performer, rhythmically wiggling his butt with enthusiasm and passion as he chases his favourite toys."
    },
    {
      "Key": "CAT_DESCRIPTION_015",
      "String": "Ninja likes to dine with good company, and will go to great lengths to find trustworthy companions. When someone suitable is discerned, he will meow to indicate they have been chosen as his special dinner guest."
    },
    {
      "Key": "CAT_DESCRIPTION_016",
      "String": "Cute, smart and talented, Sasha was likely worshipped as a goddess in a past life. She was a pageant cat prior to her adoption, and spends her days a little differently now; grooming her favourite toy until it’s covered in saliva."
    },
    {
      "Key": "CAT_DESCRIPTION_017",
      "String": "A cuddle from Milo is like having a fluffy blanket of love. He seems to have a sixth sense for knowing when people are feeling down and loves to comfort them with play and lots of affectionate purring."
    },
    {
      "Key": "CAT_DESCRIPTION_018",
      "String": "Mese was an aloof warrior with a soft heart. He learned to fight other kittens through patience, surprise, and a whirlwind back kick attack. Retired from fighting, he’s often found grooming and reminiscing of his battle days."
    },
    {
      "Key": "CAT_DESCRIPTION_019",
      "String": "Oreo is not as sweet as her name suggests...she loves pats but will attack anyone who touches her fluffy belly. Adorable but fierce, Oreo gets what she wants, when she wants."
    },
    {
      "Key": "CAT_DESCRIPTION_020",
      "String": "After being a little too curious as a kitten, Britney is deaf in one ear. Her enchanting green eyes are always alert when she ventures outside for her favourite pastime; finding a delicious patch of grass to nibble on."
    },
    {
      "Key": "CAT_DESCRIPTION_021",
      "String": "Super protective of her sleeping locations, one of Ziggy favourite places to nap is on top of the toilet tank! Despite constantly being kicked out of the bathroom, she somehow always finds a way back."
    },
    {
      "Key": "CAT_DESCRIPTION_022",
      "String": "Milky melts hearts with her affinity for kneading her favourite blanket almost all day. When she’s not kneading blankets, she’s kneading customer laps, pillows and sometimes if she’s feeling brave, other cats in the cafe."
    },
    {
      "Key": "CAT_DESCRIPTION_023",
      "String": "Found as a wee kitten completely flea-ridden, Mittens is a true survivor! Her determination can be seen today by the relentless effort to chase and catch her own tail. One day, Mittens, one day."
    },
    {
      "Key": "CAT_DESCRIPTION_024",
      "String": "Despite being well-fed, Cinnamon is exceptionally greedy and will try to steal as many cookies as she can from customer plates. Often found mleming water from the barista table."
    },
    {
      "Key": "CAT_DESCRIPTION_025",
      "String": "Named for the Greek goddess of discord, Eris is a proud trouble-maker. She  loves scratching up a storm and making people get out of their seats for her."
    },
    {
      "Key": "CAT_DESCRIPTION_026",
      "String": "Maybe use Simba's description here with the name replaced."
    },
    {
      "Key": "CAT_DESCRIPTION_027",
      "String": "Bonni’s delightfully cute ears are thanks to her Scottish Fold breed. Don’t be fooled by her often blank stare and folded ears, she can hear e v e r y t h i n g."
    },
    {
      "Key": "CAT_DESCRIPTION_028",
      "String": "An unusual kitty who loves a weekly soak in the tub, Ramses thrives on attention and can be sociable with pretty much anybody. Potentially even a kind-hearted dog!"
    },
    {
      "Key": "CAT_DESCRIPTION_029",
      "String": "Coco is a precious cat with a soft musical meow. She prefers to be in serene locations, away from the hustle and bustle of everyday life. Take her away for a quiet brush and she’ll love you forever."
    },
    {
      "Key": "CAT_DESCRIPTION_030",
      "String": "Puff enjoys perching in a loaf for hours on end, watching each and every patron come through the cafe and quietly mewing to each customer as they leave. This also means he is always in the most opportune position for pats."
    },
    {
      "Key": "CAT_DESCRIPTION_031",
      "String": "You can often hear Jellybean coming for a mile away. Whether it's chasing a toy or a real mouse she runs with extreme vigour, and thumps around surprisingly loudly for a cat. Subtlety is not her forte."
    },
    {
      "Key": "CAT_DESCRIPTION_032",
      "String": "Ori is a complete diva. She is an unique ragdoll breed and acts like a celebrity, meowing incessantly until she gets what she wants. What does she even want? No one really knows."
    },
    {
      "Key": "CAT_DESCRIPTION_033",
      "String": "Jessie is a cat full of pride. She walks like a supermodel, with her tail held high and a smug look in her eyes. She usually prefers time to herself, but isn’t afraid to demand cuddles when she wants them."
    },
    {
      "Key": "CAT_DESCRIPTION_034",
      "String": "Sandra is a low-key kleptomaniac. She steals straws from customers if they aren’t watching and chews them until they are nothing but mush. Good thing the cafe uses paper straws!"
    },
    {
      "Key": "CAT_DESCRIPTION_035",
      "String": "As an ex showcat, Fluffy spent most of her days chained or locked up. Now, Fluffy’s truly playful personality can be seen all throughout the cafe. Mostly because she malts. A lot."
    },
    {
      "Key": "CAT_DESCRIPTION_036",
      "String": "Like her marsupial namesake, Koala is extremely clingy and loves to wrap her paws around customer necks. This can result in some surprise claw marks for the unassuming but is too adorable for cafe goers to worry about."
    },
    {
      "Key": "CAT_DESCRIPTION_037",
      "String": "Wilford loves belly rubs! He will generally sleep on his back, like he’s waiting for someone to accept the invitation for a good petting. Sometimes his dreams cause his legs to flail around like he is riding a bike."
    },
    {
      "Key": "CAT_DESCRIPTION_038",
      "String": "A sweet and kind natured boy, Creedance will only accept the gentlest of pats. Imagine you are stroking a newborn baby’s head."
    },
    {
      "Key": "CAT_DESCRIPTION_039",
      "String": "Biscuit is a kitty you need to keep your eye on. He likes to be carried around, and will jump on people's shoulders when they least expect it! Biscuit loves playful people and is very adept at learning tricks."
    },
    {
      "Key": "CAT_DESCRIPTION_040",
      "String": "Pepper is a rare bengal who will eat anything. She got her name from eating a rogue chili on the cafe counter as a kitten which famously required a frantic 1am trip to the vet."
    },
    {
      "Key": "CAT_DESCRIPTION_041",
      "String": "Paddles once used her polydactyl paws to shake the hands of citizens, now retired, she uses her mittens to sip tea and munch cat biscuits. Some customers affectionately refer to her “Stardust”"
    },
    {
      "Key": "CAT_DESCRIPTION_050",
      "String": "Butter was the winner of an internet popularity contest, thrusting him into the limelight of fame on social media. Despite being a celebrity, he is still the chillest boy you will ever meet. He loves chin scritches and will curl his tail into a little question mark shape when he’s happy."
    },
    {
      "Key": "CAT_DESCRIPTION_051",
      "String": "Wild at heart and playful by nature Luna is a frisky kitty with a passion for games. Originally, she was discovered all alone in a dark scary forest. But these days she can enjoy the novelties of being a kitten by playing with toys and giving love-taps to the faces of sleeping humans."
    },
    {
      "Key": "CAT_DESCRIPTION_052",
      "String": "Gifted with talents for stalking, and running, Socks is a natural born Hunter. Quickest of them all, Socks will be the first to pin down a toy and is partial to erratic sprints around the room. Another favoured activity is sitting at the window and chattering impatiently at birds outside."
    },
    {
      "Key": "CAT_DESCRIPTION_053",
      "String": "In his youth, Possum was a particularly ambitious climber who spent his days scaling the tallest of trees. Now, Possum acts as a tiny cafe masseuse, spending his days gently kneading customer laps and purring with delight."
    },
    {
      "Key": "CAT_DESCRIPTION_054",
      "String": "Despite being dealt the misfortune of only having one eye, nothing gets Odie down! Bursting with energy, Odie loves to zip up trees and chase balls, but is still happy to snuggle down on your lap if you need a hug. She also loves the sound of her own voice and will happily chat away to you in a series of chirps, squeaks, meows and purrs."
    },
    {
      "Key": "CAT_DESCRIPTION_055",
      "String": "Calista is a kitty who appreciates a good bedtime lullaby. Sing to her in bed and she will fall asleep right next to you! She also has a fondness for plushies with lots of legs! Her collection includes a spider, octopus, lobster, crab and shrimp!"
    },
    {
      "Key": "CAT_DESCRIPTION_056",
      "String": "Starlord is always shy around new people, but quickly comes out of her shell once you get to know her. As her new best friend you can spend hours listening to this chatty cat and playing her favourite game of fetch!"
    },
    {
      "Key": "CAT_DESCRIPTION_057",
      "String": "Zoe absolutely loves people and dogs, but doesn't get along well with other cats. She loves belly rubs, being talked to, and rubbing her face on everything (including your face). Zoe has an Instagram & a very dedicated fanbase: instagram.com/munchkinzoe/"
    },
    {
      "Key": "CAT_DESCRIPTION_058",
      "String": "In her vicious hunts, Duchess Draka Hellscream's favorite victims are toes. Whether they be under a blanket or foolishly unprotected, none are safe!"
    },
    {
      "Key": "CAT_DESCRIPTION_059",
      "String": "Apollo loves making things explode, these items include packets of yeast, fish food, and powdered milk. Don’t let him near the coffee beans! Despite his bad boy tendencies he is very loving and will do anything for a snack!"
    },
    {
      "Key": "CAT_DESCRIPTION_060",
      "String": "Vivian (ViVi) is a very particular girl, only accepting face and neck pets on her own terms. She has a slight limp but nevertheless loves to run chase and climb and playtime usually ends up with a majestic blep!"
    },
    {
      "Key": "CAT_DESCRIPTION_061",
      "String": "Before she was rescued Patches lost the tips of her ears to frostbite. Overcoming her past hardships, Patches shows up to be a companion wherever she is needed most. This goofball loves playing and meows incessantly."
    },
    {
      "Key": "CAT_DESCRIPTION_062",
      "String": "Chiki is a very serious cat who does not tolerate any nonsense! He takes his jobs as protector and 5:30am alarm clock seriously and never skips work. Treats must be given to Chiki at 5pm or he will not stop meowing until he has them!"
    },
    {
      "Key": "CAT_DESCRIPTION_063",
      "String": "Mushu is a big loaf who loves loafs! He will chew through any plastic bread bag to get to those sweet bready rewards inside. This talkative guy will chirp away whenever he wants something (usually more bread)."
    },
    {
      "Key": "CAT_DESCRIPTION_064",
      "String": "This big baby, Chumby, has a rumbling purr that can be heard for miles when she gets her chin scratched in just the right spot. She has an addiction to padding on fluffy jerseys and can be often caught with her tongue sticking out"
    },
    {
      "Key": "CAT_DESCRIPTION_065",
      "String": "Dobbie is one smart cookie; from a young age she quickly adapted to learning how to communicate with humans by pressing “talking” buttons. The button system had an unfortunate “accident” after too many 4am requests for treats."
    },
    {
      "Key": "CAT_DESCRIPTION_066",
      "String": "Minoes likes to think of herself as a big tough hunter, but really she is softy at heart. Her prey of choice are large singular leaves, which she then presents to humans first thing in the morning."
    },
    {
      "Key": "CAT_DESCRIPTION_067",
      "String": "Despite his wolf-like appearance, Wolfgang is friendly and gentle most of the time… just don’t get between him and chicken. He will go through anyone and anything to get a tasty morsel!"
    },
    {
      "Key": "CAT_DESCRIPTION_068",
      "String": "<CAT_NAME_068>, named after the mischievous god in Norse mythology, has a playful streak! This kitty is known to occasionally shred stray cords or sneak a taste of a distracted human’s food. To keep this cunning kitty out of trouble, be sure to give plenty of snuggles!"
    },
    {
      "Key": "CAT_DESCRIPTION_JUHANOTUSED",
      "String": "Once Juhas’ grumpy butt hits the floor, no force in the world can make him move! Despite this, he loves pats and is extremely loyal to his favourite people. It's a shame traveling to him is the only way to reap the rewards."
    },
    {
      "Key": "CAT_DESCRIPTION_SIMBANOTUSED",
      "String": "Often surprising people with his agile grace and athleticism, Simba is very bright and has even learnt how to open doors! But these talents are purely used to guarantee finding someone for cuddles."
    },
