    {
      "Key": "VIP_NAME_001",
      "String": "Cherry"
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_OCCUPATION_001",
      "String": "Lifestyle Blogger"
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_001_DESCRIPTION_1",
      "String": "Cherry loves house plants, is addicted to reality television, and drinks too much black coffee."
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_001_DESCRIPTION_2",
      "String": "Her childhood cat Max was her best friend. She would whisper all of her secrets to him."
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_001_DESCRIPTION_3",
      "String": "Inspired by Max, Cherry has been vegetarian from a young age. She wants all animals to be loved and cherished."
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_001_DESCRIPTION_4",
      "String": "When Max passed, she swore to never have another and instead would dedicate time to saving cats in need. Visiting the cafe gives a regular fix of much needed kitty love and caffeine."
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_NAME_002",
      "String": "Sarah"
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_OCCUPATION_002",
      "String": "2D Artist"
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_002_DESCRIPTION_1",
      "String": "Sarah loves video games and is very kind and caring. She makes sure to use plenty of emojis in her messages."
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_002_DESCRIPTION_2",
      "String": "She is traditionally an indoor person, a little socially anxious, and always wears a hat when venturing outside."
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_002_DESCRIPTION_3",
      "String": "Sarah was once strictly a dog person due to cat allergies until she visited her first cat cafe on a date and fell in love. With the cats, not her date."
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_002_DESCRIPTION_4",
      "String": "She needs to take antihistamines to visit the cafe, but knows the sneezes are worth it for the cuddles. The routine of being around cats calms her anxiety."
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_NAME_003",
      "String": "Riley"
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_OCCUPATION_003",
      "String": "Bartender"
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_003_DESCRIPTION_1",
      "String": "Riley always wears a beanie, loves a good soy cappuccino and will argue until the day they die that cats are superior to dogs."
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_003_DESCRIPTION_2",
      "String": "They love to smoosh their face into kitty’s bellies and their favourite thing in the world is when cats make little chirping noises."
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_003_DESCRIPTION_3",
      "String": "Tragically lost custody of their beloved cat, Sparkle, in a messy breakup with their girlfriend."
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_003_DESCRIPTION_4",
      "String": "Riley finds happiness and solace through the cats at the cafe. They hope to one day open up a place full of joy and happiness, just like yours."
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_NAME_004",
      "String": "Jun Seo"
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_OCCUPATION_004",
      "String": "Graphic Designer"
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_004_DESCRIPTION_1",
      "String": "Jun Seo’s passion lies in designing and printing his very own brand of t-shirts."
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_004_DESCRIPTION_2",
      "String": "He has never been a cat person, but upon discovering the popularity of cats on the Internet he came to the cafe to learn more about them, and to incorporate them into his shirt designs."
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_004_DESCRIPTION_3",
      "String": "His research soon turned to love. Many of the cats recognise him, bounding towards him upon arrival and purring with excitement."
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_004_DESCRIPTION_4",
      "String": "Jun Seo recently adopted his very own senior cat to “research” from the comfort of his home. He still visits the cafe to get his regular tea and cuddles from the cats he grew to love."
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_NAME_005",
      "String": "Jordan"
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_OCCUPATION_005",
      "String": "Assistant Chef"
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_005_DESCRIPTION_1",
      "String": "Jordan works up to 60 hours a week and really values his down time. This mostly involves watching anime and playing video games with his friends."
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_005_DESCRIPTION_2",
      "String": "Jordan works a lot, mostly due to the demand of his career, as well as paying off his student loan and to save money for his dream trip to visit Japan!"
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_005_DESCRIPTION_3",
      "String": "Despite being so busy, he is currently studying Japanese language and discovered that Cat Cafes became popularised in Japan."
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_005_DESCRIPTION_4",
      "String": "Spending time at the cafe is the only time he truly gets to relax. Petting his furry friends has become Jordan’s go to activity for stress relief!"
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_NAME_006",
      "String": "Suzy"
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_OCCUPATION_006",
      "String": "Makeup Artist"
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_006_DESCRIPTION_1",
      "String": "Suzy is a Scorpio who loves taking selfies and listening to podcasts about medieval history. Her favorite color is black."
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_006_DESCRIPTION_2",
      "String": "She is a self made makeup artist and her success on social media and love for animals allowed her to create her own cruelty free brand of makeup."
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_006_DESCRIPTION_3",
      "String": "Inspired by her own cat, Pebbles, her makeup speciality is a bold cat eye look. The eyeliner wings are as sharp as an obsidian sword."
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_006_DESCRIPTION_4",
      "String": "Sadly, Pebbles passed away from old age recently and so Suzy comes to the cafe for free wifi, delicious beverages, and cuddles from her new cafe kitty friends."
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_NAME_007",
      "String": "Rin"
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_OCCUPATION_007",
      "String": "Musician"
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_007_DESCRIPTION_1",
      "String": "Rin loves karaoke, has dyed her hair every possible colour and is of course obsessed with cats."
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_007_DESCRIPTION_2",
      "String": "Her casual karaoke sessions eventually inspired her to start her own solo act; “Cats in Suits.” Her musical influences run deep, ranging from classical music to throat singing."
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_007_DESCRIPTION_3",
      "String": "Rin tries to weave anything cat related into her lyrics, gaining inspiration from famous cats in literature and frequent visits to the cafe."
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_007_DESCRIPTION_4",
      "String": "Inspired by the cafe cats, she wrote and released her latest song, “Scratching Post Strains.” It has since gained success on local radio and she is now a recognised star!"
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_NAME_008",
      "String": "Jada"
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_OCCUPATION_008",
      "String": "Junior Doctor"
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_008_DESCRIPTION_1",
      "String": "Jada is a straight-A student who zipped through college like a pro. She has multiple degrees, but decided that her passion is helping people with medicine."
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_008_DESCRIPTION_2",
      "String": "If she’s not working, Jada loves thrift shopping, drinking as much coffee as possible, and volunteering at local cat shelters."
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_008_DESCRIPTION_3",
      "String": "Jada has always been supremely kind and is the first to offer help to those in need, be it friend or stranger."
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_008_DESCRIPTION_4",
      "String": "Her selflessness and busy lifestyle does not allow her the time to have her own cat. Jada tries to visit the cafe as much as she can for some much needed kitty cuddles."
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_NAME_009",
      "String": "Leon"
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_OCCUPATION_009",
      "String": "Grocer"
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_009_DESCRIPTION_1",
      "String": "Leon is first and foremost a champion for animals. When he’s not fighting for justice, he works selling local produce at his store, ‘Purrfect Produce’."
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_009_DESCRIPTION_2",
      "String": "His adopted cat, Button, was first found yowling and frightened. Button had been neglected for a long time, living alone under Leon’s very own store."
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_009_DESCRIPTION_3",
      "String": "Button and Leon now enjoy a life of quiet pleasantry, and both are greeted like an old friend by every regular customer who comes into the store."
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_009_DESCRIPTION_4",
      "String": "Leon loves to visit your cafe to see the joy in every new adoption. He is an advocate for many cat-related charities and comes by the cafe to support and promote them!"
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_NAME_010",
      "String": "Rupert"
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_OCCUPATION_010",
      "String": "Freelance Programmer"
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_010_DESCRIPTION_1",
      "String": "Rupert is not interested in conventional adult responsibilities and prefers to live his life freely. He works wherever he wants, whenever he wants."
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_010_DESCRIPTION_2",
      "String": "Rupert’s friends think he is a bit of a rebel when really he is sensitive and caring at heart. He loves animals and has a pet rat called Dino."
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_010_DESCRIPTION_3",
      "String": "He worries that having his own cat would upset Dino, believing they would not get along together. He goes to the cafe for secret snuggles."
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_010_DESCRIPTION_4",
      "String": "Coming to the cafe is his only source of routine. He loves it so much, he has started an art blog with fan art of all of the cats!"
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_NAME_011",
      "String": "Luca"
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_OCCUPATION_011",
      "String": "Librarian"
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_011_DESCRIPTION_1",
      "String": "Enamoured with the written word since he was young, Luca has always been surrounded by literature. His favorite genre is supernatural romance."
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_011_DESCRIPTION_2",
      "String": "The local library cat, Behemoth, has been one of his best friends since he began working there at 16. Luca’s dream is to become a best selling author."
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_011_DESCRIPTION_3",
      "String": "Luca became deaf in his early twenties and loves teaching sign language classes after work. Behemoth enjoys the pats from his students."
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_011_DESCRIPTION_4",
      "String": "A student recommended checking out your cafe and since visiting he has started writing his first novel! It is inspired by the happiness radiating from your cafe."
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_NAME_012",
      "String": "Jiyoo"
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_OCCUPATION_012",
      "String": "Photographer"
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_012_DESCRIPTION_1",
      "String": "Jiyoo loves photography, painting and poetry. Despite her confidence in her toolbelt of creative skill, she is very shy when meeting new people."
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_012_DESCRIPTION_2",
      "String": "Overalls are her favorite; it's so easy to paint in them. Her adopted kitten, Belle, likes to sit in the pockets."
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_012_DESCRIPTION_3",
      "String": "Jiyoo takes her creativity very seriously, using her kitty photos as painting reference. When she is truly inspired, she even writes poetry about the cats she meets!"
    },
    {
      "Key": "VIP_012_DESCRIPTION_4",
      "String": "Fueled by waffles and inspiration from your cafe, Jiyoo plans to showcase her work for an upcoming art exhibition called Paws: Pictures, Painting and Poetry."
    },
